	<meta property="og:description" content="T1 executives have been telling investors that it had stopped buying solar cells from Trina Solar, the Chinese solar giant. A whistleblower came forward and shared 26 invoices for solar cell purchases T1 made. They all came from the &quot;Chinese Military Company,&quot; Trina Solar." />
